          "benefits_md": "\n  - **Access to Loan:** \n\n\n   1. **For purchasing 2 Buffaloes:** ₹20,000/-.   1. **For purchasing 21 Goats:** 24,500/-.\n\n  - **Interest Rate:** 14.5% to 16.5% (subject to change).\n<br>\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "The scheme provides loans to farmers for the purpose of animal husbandry, allowing them to improve their income through livestock.\n",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The \"Primary Cooperative Agriculture and Rural Development Bank: For Animal Husbandry\" scheme launched by the Co-operation, Food and Consumer Protection Department, Tamil Nadu, aims to provide financial support to farmers specifically for animal husbandry activities. This initiative aims to empower farmers by boosting livestock development and enhancing agricultural productivity."
